r><songwriter>Shellback</songwriter><songwriter>Taylor Swift</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">我知道你喜欢我</text><text for="L2">这让我有点惊慌</text><text for="L3">站在这里等着 等着</text><text for="L4">你可爱的小雀斑和明亮的眼眸 令我着了迷</text><text for="L5">说不出话来</text><text for="L6">但现在 你如此遥不可及 我黯然神伤</text><text for="L7">感觉就像迷失在茫茫人海中</text><text for="L8">我努力靠近你 惴惴不安</text><text for="L9">因为你也许是我深深爱恋的那个人</text><text for="L10">我也许是你梦寐以求的那个人</text><text for="L11">我唯有丢出一封瓶中信</text><text for="L12">伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里</text><text for="L13">你也许是我珍藏心间的那个人</text><text for="L14">我也许是你夜不能眠的缘由</text><text for="L15">我唯有丢出一封瓶中信</text><text for="L16">伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里</text><text for="L17">这些天我坐立不安</text><text for="L18">工作日变得无尽漫长</text><text for="L19">看看你把我变成了什么样 变成了什么样</text><text for="L20">但时间流逝得更快</text><text for="L21">你的笑声不断回放着</text><text for="L22">泛滥成灾</text><text for="L23">因为现在 你如此遥不可及 我黯然神伤</text><text for="L24">感觉就像迷失在茫茫人海中</text><text for="L25">我努力靠近你 惴惴不安</text><text for="L26">因为你也许是我深深爱恋的那个人 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(因为)</span></text><text for="L27">我也许是你梦寐以求的那个人</text><text for="L28">我唯有丢出一封瓶中信</text><text for="L29">伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(抵达你那里)</span></text><text for="L30">你也许是我珍藏心间的那个人</text><text for="L31">我也许是你夜不能眠的缘由</text><text for="L32">我唯有丢出一封瓶中信 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(一封瓶中信就是我的全部)</span></text><text for="L33">伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里</text><text for="L34">伦敦怎么样 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(伦敦)</span></text><text for="L35">你在哪儿 当我正满心疑惑时 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(疑惑)</span></text><text for="L36">我还会再见到你吗</text><text for="L37">你也许是我深深爱恋的那个人</text><text for="L38">现在 我伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里</text><text for="L39">因为你也许是我深深爱恋的那个人 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(耶-耶-欸)</span></text><text for="L40">我也许是你梦寐以求的那个人 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(哦)</span></text><text for="L41">我唯有丢出一封瓶中信</text><text for="L42">伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(抵达你那里)</span></text><text for="L43">你也许是我珍藏心间的那个人</text><text for="L44">我也许是你夜不能眠的缘由 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(我夜不能眠)</span></text><text for="L45">我唯有丢出一封瓶中信 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(耶 耶)</span></text><text for="L46">伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里 <span ttm:role="x-bg">(耶 耶)</span></text><text for="L47">你也许是我深深爱恋的那个人</text><text for="L48">你也许是我深深爱恋的那个人</text><text for="L49">我的挚爱</text><text for="L50">现在 我伫立在这儿 希望它能抵达你那里</text></translation><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L31"><span ttm:role="x-bg">(我……)</span></text><text for="L47"><span ttm:role="x-bg">爱</span></text><text for="L48"><span ttm:role="x-bg">爱</span></text><text for="L49"><span ttm:role="x-bg">(爱)</span></text></translation></translations><audio lyricOffset="0.950" role="spatial"/></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:40.723"><div begin="00:05.045" end="00:20.952" itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="00:05.045" end="00:07.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:05.045" end="00:05.275">I</span> <span begin="00:05.309" end="00:06.622">know</span> <span begin="00:06.622" end="00:06.800">that</span> <span begin="00:06.827" end="00:07.087">you</span> <span begin="00:07.087" end="00:07.523">like</span> <span begin="00:07.649" end="00:07.973">me</span></p><p begin="00:08.203" end="00:10.024" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:08.203" end="00:08.408">And</span> <span begin="00:08.408" end="00:08.653">it's</span> <span begin="00:08.653" end="00:09.140">kinda</span> <span begin="00:09.140" end="00:09.708">fright</span><span begin="00:09.725" end="00:09.859">en</span><span begin="00:09.859" end="00:10.024">ing</span></p><p begin="00:10.390" end="00:13.061" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:10.390" end="00:10.678">Stan</span><span begin="00:10.678" end="00:10.966">ding</span> <span begin="00:10.966" end="00:11.217">here</span> <span begin="00:11.281" end="00:11.770">wai</span><span begin="00:11.770" end="00:12.029">ting,</span> <span begin="00:12.281" end="00:12.821">wai</span><span begin="00:12.821" end="00:13.061">ting</span></p><p begin="00:13.334" end="00:18.989" ttm:agent="v1" i